b_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620620/extras/75ff13a6899b7d9d9f71511beba20d71.webp?t=1755175950\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620620/extras/656a19d5afd0d84ada5d87ab2b5d0ffa.avif?t=1755175950\" width=616 height=365 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the shop</strong>, you can buy new gear, healing potions, and the most delicious apples! Don\u2019t hesitate to grab a weapon and test it out \u2014 you might just like one more than the rest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to visit the tavern and taste the local delicacies. Plus, the innkeeper\u2019s always up for a round of cards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before bed, don\u2019t forget to prep your gear for the next day! Remember \u2014 the right equipment will save not only your life, but the lives of the civilians too!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620620/extras/e1687338f03fad440348f1932ef194f3.poster.avif?t=1755175950\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620620/extras/e1687338f03fad440348f1932ef194f3.webm?t=1755175950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620620/extras/f87bf9b5a670cd4f8be7b9b7c34490c5.webp?t=1755175950\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It is almost impossible</strong> to meet identical visitors! Gatekeeper's Week's generation system is capable of creating more than 60 million unique portraits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings new challenges: decrees change, rules tighten, fresh threats emerge. Today you\u2019re looking for fake seals \u2014 tomorrow, tracking werewolf bite marks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career growth:\u00a0</strong>loyal service is rewarded! Get new ranks, access to improved equipment, and cash rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linearity and consequences!</strong> The game features multiple endings: slack off, and you\u2019ll be discharged. Fight poorly, and you might end up permanently injured or dead.</p></li></ul>",
